          "id": "step-6-1",
          "claim": "Step 1.1 proves the implication $f\\in U\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Neg}(f)$ finite, together with the bound $|\\operatorname{Neg}(f)|\\le\\ell(w)$ and the containment $\\operatorname{Neg}(f)\\subseteq N(w^{-1})$ of (5); step 1.2 proves (2); steps 2.1 and 3.1 prove the reduction identity of (3), and step 4.1 the converse direction of (1) and the termination after exactly $|\\operatorname{Neg}(f)|$ steps; step 5.1 proves the convexity and scaling statements of (4). No Choice is used: the induction is on the natural number $|\\operatorname{Neg}(f)|$, and the element $s$ of step 2.1 is a single instantiation from a nonempty finite set of simple reflections. All clauses (1)-(5) are proved.",
