        },
        {
          "id": "step-2-1",
          "claim": "Interior and vertex stabilizers, (iii). The functional $(1,1)$ lies in $C^\\circ$ and has empty zero set, so its stabilizer is $W_\\emptyset=\\{1\\}$; the origin has $S(0)=\\{s,t\\}$, so its stabilizer is $W_S=W$, of order $6$ by step 1.1.",
          "step": "2.1",
          "inputs": [
            "F3",
            "F10",
